  "validation_domain": "380 original app ARM executions: 60 wheel cases with zero through five views, INT_MIN/-1/0/1/INT_MAX delta, both axes and alternating observed callback returns; 320 selection combinations covering INT_MIN/-1/0/1/INT_MAX index, selection false/true, target 0/1/2/9, null/non-null userData, null row and three non-null-row trigger values (including INT_MAX). Actual CCL models, ListView attach/detach, list item storage, View inherited wheel return, Parameter/Component lookup and real owner selection implementation execute. Every forwarded event is the same object; no early stop. Invalidation follows captured owner calls. A target-lookup probe mutates row userData after the original read and confirms the selected identity was captured once before lookup.",
